  "content": "\n\n<h2>Zegarn PvP 资源包</h2>\n<p>极简 PvP 资源包，专注于<strong>清晰、舒适与简洁的视觉效果</strong>。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpvp-zegarn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Modrinth 获取更快更新</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforms.gle%252f7Km7EkeKcx7sAbDv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">报告漏洞或提出建议</a></span></p>\n<h2>✦ 更新日志</h2>\n<p><strong>1.3.4</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>新图标</li>\n<li>全新全景菜单 <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c5ac2780a357a5679a1033cf11852c0f5426512_0.webp\" alt=\"全景\"></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1.3.3</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>新物品栏高亮</li>\n<li>新提示框背景</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 功能特性</h2>\n<p><strong>视觉效果</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>简洁极简的 HUD</li>\n<li>深色界面主题</li>\n<li>自定义准星</li>\n<li>自定义天空</li>\n<li>自定义主菜单与全景</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>纹理</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>重做盔甲、物品与方块纹理</li>\n<li>重做不死图腾纹理</li>\n<li>更新末影水晶纹理</li>\n<li>重做盾牌纹理</li>\n<li>更新细雪纹理</li>\n<li>小型火焰纹理</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>玩法改进</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>作物生长指示器</li>\n<li>生命值与饥饿值重着色</li>\n<li>红石系统微调</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>音效</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>自定义音效（已更新并优化）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用户界面 / GUI</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>重新设计背包界面</li>\n<li>优化提示框与高亮显示</li>\n<li>更整洁的界面元素</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 依赖要求</h2>\n<p><strong>天空 (Forge)：</strong> <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></span></p>\n<p><strong>天空 (Fabric)：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fDWuwk8aA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyboxify</a></span></li>\n<li>或</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fYBz7DOs8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit</a></span> 与 <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fHpdHOPOp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit Interop</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 俄语版本</h2>\n<h2>✦ 特性</h2>\n<p><strong>视觉效果</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>简洁极简的 HUD</li>\n<li>深色界面主题</li>\n<li>自定义准星</li>\n<li>自定义天空</li>\n<li>自定义主菜单与全景</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>纹理</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>重做盔甲、物品与方块纹理</li>\n<li>重做不死图腾纹理</li>\n<li>更新末影水晶纹理</li>\n<li>重做盾牌纹理</li>\n<li>更新细雪纹理</li>\n<li>小型火焰纹理</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>玩法改进</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>作物生长指示器</li>\n<li>生命值与饥饿值重着色</li>\n<li>红石系统微调</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>音效</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>自定义音效（已更新并优化）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用户界面 / GUI</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>重新设计背包界面</li>\n<li>优化提示框与高亮显示</li>\n<li>更整洁的界面元素</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 依赖要求</h2>\n<p><strong>天空 (Forge)：</strong> <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></span></p>\n<p><strong>天空 (Fabric)：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fDWuwk8aA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyboxify</a></span></li>\n<li>或</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fYBz7DOs8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit</a></span> 与 <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fHpdHOPOp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit Interop</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 鸣谢</h2>\n<p>部分方块纹理基于：<span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones</a></span></p>",
